        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"I've been your host, Mac Miller (What?)",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Been great spendin' the evenin' with you (What? What?)",
          "rhyme":"u",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"Let's ride out (Ride out; Ayo, Jerm, make sure they feel this)",
