        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Matter fact, bitch, I ain't even half-way finished (Nah)",
          "rhyme":"Ed",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Y'all fragile, held up in your glass case (Bitch)",
          "rhyme":"az",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"Your grind sleepy like that foreign dude runnin' the Rat Race (Haha)",
          "rhyme":"as",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"Ass face, all your music nothin' but bad taste",
          "rhyme":"ast",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"I murder beats, you can ask Ma$e, homie",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"My shit I drop stinkier than trash day (Trash day)",
          "rhyme":"E",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"I ain't gotta change shit, I'm so dangerous (Uh-huh)",
          "rhyme":"u",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"And my style like a smile, so contagious",
          "rhyme":"u",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"Bitches givin' me they hearts",
          "rhyme":"aR",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"So consistent, never smart",
          "rhyme":"aRt",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"'Cause they always beggin' me not to break it (Break it)",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"And I'ma make it (Make it)",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"15",
          "text":"I'm somethin' you don't really see often",
          "rhyme":"En",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"16",
          "text":"Gonna be the greatest and that just ain't just the weed talkin' (Nah)",
          "rhyme":"in",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"17",
          "text":"I tell these people, \"Give me a clue\"",
